                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="378 1751 378 1763 2135 1768 2139 1747 2135 1718 2063 1706 2061 1706 2059 1706 2032 1716 1890 1706 1888 1706 1787 1716 1689 1706 1687 1706 1685 1706 1646 1716 1615 1706 1613 1706 1611 1706 1609 1706 1570 1716 1500 1706 1498 1706 1496 1706 1494 1706 1479 1718 1344 1718 1297 1706 1295 1706 1235 1718 633 1708 631 1708 629 1708 627 1708 611 1720 454 1720 401 1708 399 1708 397 1708 376 1718 378 1751"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the sons should not divide it into small parts, but should keep it together,"/>
                    </TextLine>

